ong>Playing for both Sites</strong> - Be an author of both SCP Wiki and Wanderer's Library (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snapdragon133" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5193476&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608491067" alt="Snapdragon133" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5193476)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snapdragon133" >Snapdragon133</a></span>)<br /> <strong>The Challenger</strong> - Complete at least three challenges on the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/writing-challenge-list">Writing Challenges List</a> (partially <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608491067" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>)<br /> <strong>Are We the Baddies?</strong> - Write an article where the Foundation is explicitly an antagonistic force. (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608491067" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>)<br /> <strong>Anartist Portfolio</strong> - Have 5 or more articles featuring your own original images. Can be your own or other authors' articles. (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pastarasta1" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2551139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608491067" alt="pastarasta1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2551139)" /></a><a href="http://w