					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The Obearwatch command returns! When I started reading this I found it peculiar that the objects were bears and when I got to the end and saw Obearwatch I was a bit confused but then I realized that this was associated with SCP 5464. I really like how these SCPs are going and I think that the continuation of the mysterious Obearwatch command in more articles would be a good idea. I can’t bear waiting for the next article! +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
